{"tmdb_id":80949,"title":"A Film by Aravind","original_title":"ఎ ఫిల్మ్ బై అరవింద్","release_year":2005,"language_code":"te","language_name":"テルグ語","industry":"トリウッド","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6t9IaPnHiXMO5Zz5t0iy9Himbqc.jpg","overview":"Aravind (Rajiv Kanakala) and Rishi (Rishi) are childhood buddies. They struggled together to come up in life and settle as director and hero respectively. They delivered two consecutive hits together and are in search of a script for a 3rd film. Of the scripts sent by various story writers, Aravind finds one script to be interesting. But that script was smudged with ink after 60th page (25th scene). He summons his assistant to scout for the writer and takes Rishi for story discussions on that script to his remote wooden guesthouse located few kilometers away from the city. The scenes mentioned in the script come alive. As the things get scary, Aravind wants to see what would happen in the next scene and realize that the rest of the script is smudged by ink. The rest of the story is all about what happens next.","cast":[{"name":"Rajeev Kanakala","character":"Aravind"},{"name":"Richard Rishi","character":"Rishi"},{"name":"Sherlyn Chopra","character":"Nirupama \"Niru\""},{"name":"Ghazal Srinivas","character":"Satyam"},{"name":"Anantha Sriram","character":"Writer"},{"name":"Mallikarjuna Rao","character":"Dhaba owner"},{"name":"Madhu","character":"House keeper"},{"name":"Mansoor Markhand","character":""}],"songs":[{"title":"Aravind Intruduction","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/aravind-intruduction/JBleawNyfno","singers":"Rajiv Kanakala"},{"title":"Sneham Sneham","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/sneham-sneham/OQUdQT5BA0E","singers":"Sandeep, Surendra Krishna"},{"title":"Aravind Discuss","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/aravind-discuss/FAk8aR57Zlw","singers":"Sandeep, Surendra Krishna"},{"title":"Nirupama Intruduction","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/nirupama-intruduction/HQo9ch8JaAA","singers":"Mona Chopr